  "description": "KYOTO WORLD is a bold Japanese-style font inspired by the vibrant energy of Japan’s street signs, ramen shops, and cultural aesthetics. This typeface combines modern brush strokes with a playful, handcrafted spirit that brings life and motion to your words. Perfect for branding, restaurant menus, packaging, merchandise, posters, and anything that craves a touch of East Asian flair, Kyoto World gives your designs that distinct, eye-catching charm.",
